    "text": "By Alex Kesler ,\n6 hours ago COLUMBIA, S.C. (WACH) — The City of Columbia identified and removed a fraudulent parking QR code sticker on a COSMO pay station on Main Street. Officials say when paying for parking by scanning a QR code, always double-check the website address. Official City of Columbia parking payments will only... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
